      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\left(\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{12}\\right)-\\cos\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{12}\\right)\\right)^2\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left(\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{12}\\right)-\\cos\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{12}\\right)\\right)^2=\n$$\n{{value}}",
